  "claim": "The 2017 South Korean period crime drama film is about the 1967 riot in the city of the same name as film that Laz Alonso had a role in which is also known as the 12th Street Riot. Will Poulter also starred in this film.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Detroit (film). Sentence: Detroit is a 2017 American period crime drama film directed by Kathryn Bigelow and written by Mark Boal.\nPage: Detroit (film). Sentence: Based on the Algiers Motel incident during Detroit's 1967 12th Street Riot, the film's release commemorated the 50th anniversary of the event.\nPage: 1967 Detroit riot. Sentence: The 1967 Detroit riot, also known as the 12th Street riot or the 1967 Detroit rebellion, was one of 159 race riots that swept cities in the United States during the \"Long Hot Summer of 1967\".\nPage: Will Poulter. Sentence: William Jack Poulter (born 28 January 1993) is an English actor known for his work in the films \"The Maze Runner\" (2014), \"Son of Rambow\", \"\" (2010), \"We're the Millers\" (2013), \"The Revenant\" (2015), and \"Detroit\" (2017).\nPage: Laz Alonso. Sentence: Alonso has had roles in other films such as \"Jarhead\", \"This Christmas\", \"Miracle at St. Anna\" and \"Detroit\".",
